    "intro_narrative": "You stand within the Celestial Sanctum, the high tower of the ancient Archmage Arithmos. The room is filled with humming crystals, floating runes, and intricate machinery fueled by pure mana. Arithmos has vanished, leaving behind his greatest treasure locked within the Vault of Eternity. To open it, you must harmonize the flow of magical energy through the room's various artifacts. The machines are dormant or disjointed; only by channeling the correct magical values from one device to another can you reconstruct the sequence that unseals the vault. The air crackles with potential—the magic awaits your command.",
    "narrative_style": "fantasy"
  },
